-Coupon support is pending.
+Prices use integer cents. Supply total_cents >= 0 and an integer percent between 0 and 100. Booleans and invalid values are rejected. The final price is rounded down to whole cents.
+
+Example: 999 cents with a 15% coupon gives 849 cents (8.49 €). The browser preview follows the same contract as the API.
